OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1786110488
OL,3,CControversial fire service cuts
OL,4,Coverwhelmingly thrown out by local
OL,5,Cleaders
OL,7,FProposals to close fire stations and
OL,8,Fslash firefighter jobs across Kent
OL,9,Fhave been overwhelmingly rejected in a
OL,10,Fmajor victory for campaigners and
OL,11,Ffrontline crews.
OL,13,FMembers of the Kent Fire Authority
OL,14,Fvoted 17-2 against plans put forward
OL,15,Fby Kent Fire and Rescue Service
OL,16,Fmanagement, which would have seen 63
OL,17,Ffirefighter roles axed, six fire
OL,18,Fengines removed, and five stations
OL,19,Fshut permanently.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1786110488
OL,3,CControversial fire service cuts
OL,4,Coverwhelmingly thrown out by local
OL,5,Cleaders
OL,7,FThe decision follows months of intense
OL,8,Fcampaigning, public demonstrations,
OL,9,Fand rallies organised by the Fire
OL,10,FBrigades Union (FBU).
OL,12,FKent Fire and Rescue Service had
OL,13,Foriginally drawn up the proposals as
OL,14,Fpart of a review into how resources
OL,15,Fare used across the county. Senior
OL,16,Fofficers argued the changes were
OL,17,Fnecessary to plug multi-million-pound
OL,18,Fbudget shortfalls caused by rising
OL,19,Finflation and operational costs.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1786110488
OL,3,CControversial fire service cuts
OL,4,Coverwhelmingly thrown out by local
OL,5,Cleaders
OL,7,FManagement also pointed to changing
OL,8,Fpatterns of emergency calls,
OL,9,Fmaintaining that some low-demand rural
OL,10,Fstations dealt with very few incidents
OL,11,Fa year.
OL,13,FThey argued that redistributing funds
OL,14,Fwould allow the service to invest more
OL,15,Fheavily in modern equipment, fire
OL,16,Fprevention work, and targeting
OL,17,Fresources in high-risk urban areas
OL,18,Fwhere call-outs are most frequent.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1786110488
OL,3,CControversial fire service cuts
OL,4,Coverwhelmingly thrown out by local
OL,5,Cleaders
OL,7,FHowever, the union and local residents
OL,8,Fwere concerned that response times in
OL,9,Frural communities would be dangerously
OL,10,Fdelayed if nearby stations closed.
OL,12,FUnder the rejected cost-cutting
OL,13,Fproposals, rural communities had faced
OL,14,Flosing local stations in Chilham, Wye,
OL,15,FCliffe, Grain, and Westerham.
OL,17,FThe plans also earmarked the removal
OL,18,Fof fire engines from Tunbridge Wells,
OL,19,FFaversham, Herne Bay, and Deal, while
OL,20,Ffire stations in Thames-Side and
OL,21,FDartford were set to lose night cover.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1786110488
OL,3,CControversial fire service cuts
OL,4,Coverwhelmingly thrown out by local
OL,5,Cleaders
OL,7,FThe FBU had warned the reductions
OL,8,Fwould severely compromise public
OL,9,Fsafety across the county, pointing out
OL,10,Fthat Kent had already lost more than
OL,11,F460 firefighter posts since 2010.
OL,13,FFollowing the vote, trade union
OL,14,Fleaders praised the local community
OL,15,Ffor joining crews to protest the cuts
OL,16,Fduring a series of rallies outside
OL,17,FCounty Hall in Maidstone.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38606
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1786110488
OL,3,CControversial fire service cuts
OL,4,Coverwhelmingly thrown out by local
OL,5,Cleaders
OL,7,FFBU General Secretary Steve Wright
OL,8,Fhailed the decision, stating: "This is
OL,9,Fa stunning victory, and I want to
OL,10,Fcongratulate Kent FBU and Kent
OL,11,Ffirefighters for their strong fighting
OL,12,Ftrade union spirit alongside the local
OL,13,Fcommunity who have been very
OL,14,Fsupportive of our campaign.
OL,16,F"Without our members' forthright stand
OL,17,Fand organising impressive rallies over
OL,18,Fthe last few months, we would not have
OL,19,Fforced this change.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38607
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1786110488
OL,3,CControversial fire service cuts
OL,4,Coverwhelmingly thrown out by local
OL,5,Cleaders
OL,7,F"This whole episode shows that when
OL,8,Fworking people stand together in unity
OL,9,Fagainst bosses' plans to erode safety
OL,10,Fand cut jobs, we are unstoppable."
OL,12,FThe rejection of the cuts ensures all
OL,13,Ffire stations will remain open,
OL,14,Fappliances will stay operational, and
OL,15,Fexisting frontline posts will be
OL,16,Fpreserved across Kent.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G7/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
